  'No pediste el registro de proveedores del SGSI: es el centro del encargo.': "You didn't request the ISMS supplier register: it's the core of the assignment.", 'No pediste el plan de tratamiento: sin él no sabes qué huecos ya están en tratamiento.': "You didn't request the treatment plan: without it you don't know which gaps are already being treated.",
